{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A familiar farm. A friendly supervisor. A rift in the sky. An evolving basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up without memory of who, what, when or why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/custom_explore.png?t=1746193738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The underground basement changes, and is never quite the same when you return to it. Supposedly the basement connects to a forest, if you can find your way there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/custom_critters.png?t=1746193738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When inside the basement, be wary of any critters and curiosities. They may look cute, but not all of them want you near them and may retaliate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/custom_objective.png?t=1746193738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather seeds, grow crops, craft items, and solve puzzles in order to complete the tasks given by your friendly supervisor.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665830?t=1746193738","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665830?t=1746193738","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/18d6f65e305982f66adb2a1df15bf1929fd60a8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746193738","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/18d6f65e305982f66adb2a1df15bf1929fd60a8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746193738","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A familiar farm. A friendly supervisor. A rift in the sky. An evolving basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up without memory of who, what, when or why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/custom_explore.png?t=1746193738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The underground basement changes, and is never quite the same when you return to it. Supposedly the basement connects to a forest, if you can find your way there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/custom_critters.png?t=1746193738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When inside the basement, be wary of any critters and curiosities. They may look cute, but not all of them want you near them and may retaliate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/custom_objective.png?t=1746193738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather seeds, grow crops, craft items, and solve puzzles in order to complete the tasks given by your friendly supervisor.</p>","developers":["BRTL Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/88efb6518bb80e5766b473772ffce392879c0bf6/header.jpg?t=1746193738","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Sprouting Depths","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set 